Description: VeltOS Photos, a Windows 11 style photo viewer
 The gallery and viewer of Windows 11's Photos: pictures and videos of
 the Pictures and Videos folders (and added folders) grouped by month,
 favorites, search, filter and sort; the viewer with zoom, rotate, delete,
 file information, filmstrip and slideshow; "Edit image" with crop,
 rotate, flip, brightness, contrast, saturation and warmth, saved in
 place or as a copy. Videos open in VeltOS Media Player.
